ind":"update","title":"Demo update — Chapter 2","summary":"A fix for the demo is live. In Chapter 2, the Chicken Feed could be used on the small statue. There is only one, and no way to get another, so spending it there left the chapter impossible to finish. The statue no longer accepts it. If you are already stuck, this cannot repair a save made before the fix — you will need to start the chapter again. We are sorry for the time that costs. Thank you to everyone who reported it. That is why we found this during the festival rather than after it. — HAEO","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043684","verified_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4817170-1846651706693657","game_id":"steam-4817170","kind":"announcement","title":"Wretched Tales: Cinderella Is in Steam Next Fest — Play the Free Demo","summary":"Wretched Tales: Cinderella is taking part in Steam Next Fest! Our free Windows demo lets you play the first two chapters in full—roughly 30 minutes of point-and-click puzzles, with support for 14 languages. Cinderella still wants to go to the ball. First, there is a hazel branch to plant and a family dinner to prepare. Familiar tasks follow unfamiliar rules. Examine objects, use items in the environment, and watch for small changes. Characters communicate through expressions, actions, and pictur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:24:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4817170-1846651706673275","game_id":"steam-4817170","kind":"announcement","title":"Cinderella’s chores take a strange turn — play the free demo","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46276167/ab26e883caad276f3e6626d59096b32d87ad0c00.png Cinderella wants to go to the ball. First, there is work to do—and a family waiting to be served. The free demo of Wretched Tales: Cinderella is now available on Steam. Explore hand-drawn 2D scenes, inspect objects, and interpret what the characters want through their expressions, actions, and image bubbles. Play the free demo from our Steam store page. After playing, tell us: was there a moment when you weren’t sure what t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:09:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4817170-1846018067930674","game_id":"steam-4817170","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Now Open","summary":"The Wretched Tales: Cinderella demo is now free to play. A hazel branch that needs planting. A dinner the family is waiting for. The first two chapters are yours in full: roughly 30 minutes of point-and-click puzzles that keep their logic in plain sight. Supports 14 languages. Take your time — nothing here is in a hurry. If something breaks, a clue feels unclear, or a scene stays with you, you can tell us on Discord. The full game is planned for later this year. If you would like to see how far ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4817170-1845383656376846","game_id":"steam-4817170","kind":"announcement","title":"A Story You Already Know","summary":"You know how this story ends. You do not know what it asks for along the way. The free Wretched Tales: Cinderella demo opens on October 8, 2026 at 10:00 AM PDT (October 9, 2:00 AM KST). A hazel branch that needs planting. A dinner the family is waiting for. It is a 2D point-and-click puzzle adventure, and nothing in it is explained outright — an expression, an object, or something out of place tells you where to look next. The demo covers the first two chapters in full: roughly 30 minutes of pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T09:13:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4817170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4817170":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4817170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z"},"4860140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:42Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4817170","app_id":4817170,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:59Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fa0745f188f15e823c9cebeac4f431fbbb53bf1b14a785530ae7a87662b167a7","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"익숙한 신데렐라 동화가 기괴한 퍼즐 어드벤처로 뒤틀립니다.\r\n정적인 2D 장면을 관찰하고, 오브젝트의 숨은 반응을 해석하며, 무도회로 향하는 잔혹한 절차를 완성하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"HAEON STUDIO Co., Ltd."}],"develo